---
code: vouched-composition-not-present
when-fires: a vouching verdict body reaches a name whose resolution leaves the composition its author wrote, so the vouch does not attach and the site runs (`28R:rul-mixed-custody-suspends-vouch` · `rul-contested-name-never-resolved`). Minted at `plan::build_vouches_from_sets`, spanned at the VOUCHING definition's name, reported once per (name, reason, voucher) through the cli's load-edge report seat. Four typed reasons, one license outcome: the BOOK redefines a helper the body calls; the BOOK defines a function under a name the body calls as an external UTILITY; two loaded sources declare the name with differing bytes and the one a shell binds is outside the voucher's custody; or the body reaches a definition vector the engine cannot enumerate. `{name}` = the reached name; `{reason}` = the typed reason's own sentence.
why: a vouch attaches to the code that will actually RUN, not to the text its author was looking at. Where the running composition is somebody else's — the admin's redefinition, another author's differing declaration that load order happened to pick, or an `eval` nobody can follow — the engineer vouched a composition that is not present, and honoring the vouch would elide a mutation on the strength of a judgment nobody made about the body that ran. Suspending is the only sound act and it can only ever suspend: the rule never mints (`28R:rul-mixed-custody-suspends-vouch`). WARNING severity with no floor, on `helper-declaration-contested`'s footing — the plan stays valid and safe, the site simply runs, and what the reader loses is value. Remediation register (help) wanted: name the one edit that restores the composition, which differs per reason — rename the book's function, load one of the two colliding sources, or take custody of the helper.
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- vouched-composition-not-present && mise run loom:promote -- vouched-composition-not-present`; prove it stuck with `mise run test`, which is also what catches anything else the promotion moved. `mise run loom:vars -- --all vouched-composition-not-present` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
-- replay --
$ dorc plan --book=book.sh -o wombat.oracle.sh
